  "summary": "Operator discloses resources and secrets scoped to other apps in github.com/dapr/dapr",
  "details": "In Kubernetes mode, the Dapr operator returns HTTPEndpoint, MCPServer, Resiliency, Subscription, and WorkflowAccessPolicy resources in a namespace without filtering by the calling app ID's scopes, and GetConfiguration serves any Configuration in the namespace by name. Any workload with a Dapr identity in the namespace can read resolved Kubernetes secrets from HTTPEndpoint, MCPServer, and Configuration resources scoped to other applications in the same namespace.",
